header: "---\nname: jake-replica-replica-architect\ndescription: \"Plans the stack, database schema and API for an app clone, from the recon map replica-recon wrote. Picks boring, managed tech, turns the inferred data model into real SQL with indexes and access rules, lists every route by flow, and orders the build as a thin vertical slice first. Use when the user says \\\"plan the clone\\\", \\\"what stack should I use\\\", \\\"design the database\\\", \\\"write the schema\\\", \\\"plan the API\\\", \\\"architecture for my version of X\\\", or after /replica-recon finishes.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/replica-skill\n  upstream_skill: replica-architect\n  upstream_commit: 77c9436fb3d18c3d58169efb8caf4fe906b0dc51\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
